Package: simsu
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qt6 Sudoku game
 A basic Sudoku game. You can switch between filling in notes
 (pencil mode), or filling in answers (pen mode). To make it easier
 to see where to place numbers, you can highlight all instances of
 a number. You can also check your answers for correctness while
 playing. The game stores your current notes and answers, so that
 you can pick up where you left off the next time you play.
